2026-10-09T22:16:50.2369245Z [36;1m# Note: There is currently no way to distinguish between undefined variables and empty strings in GitHub Actions.[0m
2026-10-09T22:16:50.2369832Z [36;1m# This limitation affects how we handle default values and empty inputs.[0m
2026-10-09T22:16:50.2370307Z [36;1m# For more information, see: https://github.com/actions/runner/issues/924[0m
2026-10-09T22:16:50.2370658Z [36;1m[0m
2026-10-09T22:16:50.2370999Z [36;1m# The following logic implements the configuration priority described in the README:[0m
2026-10-09T22:16:50.2371379Z [36;1m#[0m
2026-10-09T22:16:50.2371575Z [36;1m# Inputs[0m
